Bind Npc 24407 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14407 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 779 "[Crack of All Means] Sign"
    Journal for karus "You must perform the mission assigned by [Advisor] Herga."
    Journal for elmorad "You must perform the mission assigned by [Advisor] Nez."
    Collect 4 of 508214000

Requires player level >= 50 and quest 778 is completed

Rewards
    Give 8750000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "According to Herga, something's happening at Adonis Continent."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "According to Nez, something's happening at Adonis Continent."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "It seems you are going to help now. Like I said, find out what's causing this."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "For now, collect [Cracked Snake Scale] from [Lamia].\n\nLuferson Castle's Herga said to bring [Split Snake Scales] from [Lamia]."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "It seems you are going to help now. Like I said, find out what's causing this."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "For now, collect [Cracked Snake Scale] from [Lamia].\n\nElmorad Castle's Nez said to bring [Split Snake Scales] from [Lamia]."

On in_progress
    Say "We have no time. Hurry!"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "You brought it. Good job.\n\nI can't tell what's happening here..  Hm...   Please do me a favor again. Go find Gather."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "You brought it. Good job.\n\nI can't tell what's happening here..  Hm...   You'll need to do me a favor again. Go find Knoker."

On completed
    Say "Level up to 51 and come back."
